            <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Builds a site terrain from surveyed level curves (contours drawn at their reduced levels) and a site boundary: points on the curves and on the boundary are triangulated into a Delaunay mesh, re-sectioned across the site and lofted into a smooth terrain surface.</item>
            <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">TerrainFromRLs.gh</item>
          </items>
